  "__doc__": "login key (the JSON key) = the REAL key a person logs in / calls the gateway with. maps_to = which alias in keys.conf that real key is; allow_models empty = all; admin true = can manage the pool. jimdbtest is the exception: a shared test TICKET (not a real key) mapping to someone else's key, model-limited.",
